#* {{quote-book|nb|year=1890|author={{w|Henrik Ibsen}}|title=Hedda Gabler|page=32|url=http://ibsen.uio.no/DRVIT_HG%7CHG90.xhtml?facs=Ja|passage=Hedda (tar buketten på pianoet): «'''De''' blomster stod ikke her inat da vi kom.»|translation=Hedda (taking the bouquet from the piano): ‘Those flowers were not here last night when we arrived.’}}
#* {{quote-book|nb|year=1909|author={{w|Henrik Ibsen}}|title=Efterladte Skrifter|volume=I|page=265|url=https://www.nb.no/items/URN:NBN:no-nb_digibok_2010081720007?searchText=%22lidet%20kritisk%20udviklet%22|passage='''de''' dages publikum var {{...}} for lidet kritisk udviklet|translation=the audiences of those days were […] insufficiently developed in their critical judgment}}
#* {{quote-book|nb|year=1914|author={{w|Sigrid Undset}}|title=Vaaren|page=199|url=https://www.nb.no/items/URN:NBN:no-nb_digibok_2007050912001?searchText=%22mig,%C2%BB%20sa%20Torkild%22|passage=«'''de''' der mimoserne er fra mig,» sa Torkild|translation=‘Those mimosas there are from me,’ said Torkild}}
