##* {{quote-book|nb|year=1884|author={{w|Henrik Ibsen}}|title=Vildanden|page=63|url=https://www.ibsen.uio.no/DRVIT_Vi%7CViht.xhtml|passage=se så; er det nu '''de''' kopierne igen?|translation=now then; is it those copies again?}}
##* {{quote-book|nb|year=1885|author={{w|Henrik Ibsen}}|title=Brand|page=12|url=http://ibsen.uio.no/DRVIT_Br%7CBr85.xhtml|passage=det er svært, hvor livet er '''de''' godtfolk kært!|translation=it's remarkable how dear life is to those good people!}}
##* {{quote-book|nb|year=1896|author={{w|Henrik Ibsen}}|title=John Gabriel Borkman|page=107|url=http://ibsen.uio.no/DRVIT_JG%7CJG96.xhtml?facs=Ja|passage=å, '''de''' kvinder! '''De''' fordærver og forvansker livet for os!|translation=oh, those women! They ruin and distort life for us!}}
