##* {{quote-book|nb|year=2004|author=Siri Kristiansen|title=Siris dagbok|page=30|url=https://www.nb.no/items/URN:NBN:no-nb_digibok_2016072548077?searchText=%22foreldra%20%C3%B2g,%20da%22|passage=så har jo Line '''de''' dødsgreie foreldra òg, da|translation=and Line has such incredibly nice parents too, of course}}
