=====Usage notes=====
* The article is normally unstressed. The following noun normally has its definite suffix: ''de gamle husene'' ("the old houses"). Names, fixed expressions and formal or literary usage may lack this suffix.
* The archaic construction before an unmodified noun follows a German pattern.
* The determiner and article remain {{m|nb|de}} when the whole noun phrase is an object: ''Jeg møtte de nye naboene'' ("I met the new neighbours").

